1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,600
Scientists blast a fuel pellet with 192 lasers.

2
00:00:04,084 --> 00:00:06,480
Why do it? They want to build a star on earth.

3
00:00:07,259 --> 00:00:11,419
Fusion powers the Sun. no carbon, and the fuel comes from seawater.

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,980
The lasers crush a pellet smaller than a peppercorn,

5
00:00:15,214 --> 00:00:17,859
Until its core is hotter than the center of the Sun.

6
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,920
Last year, one shot gave back 4× the laser energy.

7
00:00:22,314 --> 00:00:24,579
But a real power plant is still years away.

8
00:00:24,963 --> 00:00:26,620
That's why, over and over,
